{"language_code":"eng","language_probability":0.9796259999275208,"text":"Every woman wants that old money workday look, but nobody tells you how to actually get there without spending thousands. That is until now, because this is the bag I bring everywhere, and people ask me where it's from constantly. This is the Vivienne from Velancia. It's soft vegetable-tanned leather with aged brass hardware, and it fits my planner, a water bottle, everything I carry in a day. It doesn't look like a work bag. It doesn't have a logo. It doesn't need one. It just looks expensive. I don't want to carry three different bags for one day, and I know you don't either. That's why I carry the Vivienne. You put your whole day in there, and it still looks like an accessory, not a carry-on. If you've been trying to find something that works for a nine AM meeting and drinks after, this is going to be the one. If you want that old money look every single day like me, I'm going to leave a link on this video. They do sell out, so grab yours while you can.","words":[{"text":"Every","start":0.099,"end":0.34,"type":"word","logprob":-0.000017046782886609435},{"text":" ","start":0.34,"end":0.439,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.000014185804502631072},{"text":"woman","start":0.439,"end":0.699,"type":"word","logprob":-0.000014185804502631072},{"text":" ","start":0.699,"end":0.74,"type":"spacing","logprob":-2.3841855067985307e-7},{"text":"wants","start":0.74,"end":0.939,"type":"word","logprob":-2.3841855067985307e-7},{"text":" ","start":0.939,"end":1.0,"type":"spacing","logprob":0.0},{"text":"that","start":1.0,"end":1.179,"type":"word","logprob":0.0},{"text":" ","start":1.179,"end":1.279,"type":"spacing","logprob":-6.318072337307967e-6},{"text":"old","start":1.279,"end":1.459,"type":"word","logprob":-6.318072337307967e-6},{"text":" ","start":1.459,"end":1.499,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.01107780635356903},{"text":"money","start":1.5,"end":1.719,"type":"word","logprob":-0.01107780635356903},{"text":" ",